<title>USA: AK Steel Holding Corp issues $550 mln debt.</title>
<headline>AK Steel Holding Corp issues $550 mln debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following high-yield debt issue from AK Steel Holding Corp was priced in the 144a private placement market late on Thursday, according to a syndicate source.</p>
<p>CS First Boston was lead manager on the deal.</p>
<p>BORROWER AK STEEL HOLDING CORP</p>
<p>AMT $550 MLN	 COUPON 9.125 PCT  MATURITY 12/15/2006</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 6/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S Ba2   YIELD 9.125 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB-MINUS  SPREAD 273 BP     CALLABLE NON CALL FIVE</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1672</p>
</text>
